            "review_title": "Review at King BBQ",
            "review_text": "216spring\nUdon Thani, Thailand802 contributions\n0\nGood food with a friendly polite service.\nDec 2018 • Couples\nWe had just finished the hotel check-in, and we were hungry, we decided to head out to find a place to eat. Under a pouring rain we stopped at the KING BBQ not knowing what to expect. They have 3 set prices for grill your own food. We picked the 329 000 Dong menu having been told that we could order any or all menu item without limit. The menu offers many different cuts of beef , pork chicken and some seafood, to be cooked at your table. The beef , pork , fish cook in aluminium paper, pork were quite good. The staff kept coming offering more dishes. We got to the closing time, yet the your ladies came and said Sir.... you must try this ... that before you leave... We just could not take any more food. She said try the seafood omelettes ( a set of 2 ) i said yes but ONLY one.. I did not regret it, it was fabulous better than in Singapore or KUL. Drinks, like everywhere in Vietnam are quite expensive except for the beer.\nThey also feature a salad bar, a dessert counter focusing to the Asian taste..\nI recommend highly.....this is an Asian restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 24, 2018",
